WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.940
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's tile some windows.

00:00:05.162 --> 00:00:08.202
Press n for a new window, then Enter to type in it.

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:11.608
Every new window finds its own place in the layout.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:20.020
Control B, then z, zooms the focused pane. Again, and it's back.

00:00:20.595 --> 00:00:22.755
Alt 2 jumps to an empty workspace.

00:00:23.397 --> 00:00:25.397
And alt 1 brings your windows back.

00:00:26.979 --> 00:00:30.019
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
